{%- comment -%}
  Distributor map for the feature cards (Figma "Distributor map – Australia" 4343:3591): every state
  and territory in its own blue, the national highways, the Melbourne hub and the state labels,
  drawn at the Figma frame size (549 x 373). Highways are dashed in CSS (stroke 4, dash 2 10, round
  caps), as in Figma. Towns stay invisible until a delivery reaches them.
  The routes in <defs> run from the hub along the highways (one per highway, end to end; Tasmania
  by ferry), read by bs-feature-illustrations.js for the delivery dots; they are never drawn.
  Generated from the Figma geometry. Decorative, so hidden from screen readers.
{%- endcomment -%}
